This repository is an unofficial installation and tuning kit for Claude-Mem
(https://github.com/thedotmack/claude-mem), Copyright 2026 Alex Newman,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The kit installs the DeepSeek Harness adapter that ships with Claude-Mem,
@claude-mem/dsh. That adapter is itself derived from

    Bleed00/dsh-claude-mem, Copyright 2026 Bleed00, Apache-2.0
    https://github.com/Bleed00/dsh-claude-mem

No Claude-Mem source code is vendored in this repository. The DSH transcript
schema embedded into ~/.claude-mem/transcript-watch.json is copied at install
time from the installed @claude-mem/dsh package.

If you redistribute Claude-Mem code together with this kit, include Claude-Mem's
LICENSE and NOTICE files, and state the changes you made, as required by
Apache-2.0.

